  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「動くな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「指先をぴくりとでも動かせば、おまえは死ぬ——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「罪の業火に焼かれ、『失楽園』において地獄の底に死屍累々となった悪魔の軍勢のように、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「無惨な屍を晒すことになるだろう。ククク、怖いか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「聞きたいことがある」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「おまえ、美術部の関係者か？　いま、美術室からでてきただろう——何？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「何？絵のモデルをしている？　そんなことは知らん、おまえはボクの質問に答えればいいんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「おまえ、演劇部の衣装などをつくっているという美術部のやつと知りあいか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「ふん、同じクラス？　それは重畳だな——皮肉屋の神もたまには気の利いたことをする！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「これを見ろ。そう、衣装の素材とデザインだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「あぁ、この黒い羽根は鴉の死骸からむしってきれいに洗った本物だから脆いぞ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「その銀細工もだ！　生まれたての赤ん坊のように丁重に扱え！　ただし悪魔の落とし仔だがな……ククク！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「久しぶりにライブの衣装を新調しようと思ったのだが、この学校には服飾関係の部活動はないしな——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「そこでいつも衣装の製作などをしているという、美術部の人間に目をつけたのだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「外注してもよかったのだが、顔も知らぬ相手に神聖なライブ衣装を任せるのは気に食わんしな——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「いいか、このデザインどおりに衣装をつくれと、美術部の人間に伝えるがいい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「え？　自分で言え？　ふん、馬鹿め。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「邪悪にして忌避されるこのボクが依頼人だとわかれば、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「愚かなる大衆は畏れ多くて手が震えてしまうだろう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「なぜか知らんが、ボクが直接話しかけると誰もが硬直し、ときには逃げだしてしまうのだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「たぶん、このボクの呪われし魂に、原罪の子らは恐怖してしまうのだろうがな——ククク。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「まぁいい、それでは頼んだぞ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「見事、この依頼を達成したあかつきには、貴様と美術部のものどもをボクのライブの特等席に案内してやる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 10,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 484
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「ボクは地獄の歌い手——翼の折れた堕天使（ルシフェル）。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "すず",
    "text": "「悪意に満ちた運命の連鎖が再び絡むことがあれば、また遭うこともあるだろう。ククク……！」"
  }
]